  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">P95 - SAFETIC &apos;&apos;Safe transportation and installations of chemicals&#xbf;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the project is to mitigate the industrial risks linked to facilities and transportation involving dangerous chemicals in the AAF region partner countries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2 main component are targeted by the new project , which is a follow up of the previous P69 nad P71, the prevention of risks in high risk installations (HRI) and safety transportation of the dangerous goods by road and rail (TDG):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Part 1&amp;nbsp;: High risk installations (HRI)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Part 2&amp;nbsp;: Dangerous Transportation by road and rail (TDG)&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
